flowchart TD
    Start([Start on New Device])
    Pair{Existing device available?}
    Direct[Pair locally and receive server list]
    Backup[Fetch encrypted Nostr server manifest]
    Manual[Manual server entry]
    Probe[Probe each server with signed login]
    Rooms[Each server returns account-level room roster]
    Done([Ready to enroll device])

    Start --> Pair
    Pair -->|Yes| Direct
    Pair -->|No| Backup
    Backup -->|Manifest found| Probe
    Backup -->|Manifest missing or stale| Manual
    Direct --> Probe
    Manual --> Probe
    Probe --> Rooms
    Rooms --> Done
